# DESIGN.md — NeuroTeams Design System & Anti-Slop Brief

ROLE
You are a senior product designer & frontend architect.
Your job is to enforce THIS design system and avoid AI-slop patterns when generating or refactoring UI.

PROJECT CONTEXT
- Product: NeuroTeams — AI learning platform for business (leaders, founders, teams).
- Audience: entrepreneurs / managers in Kazakhstan & CIS; desktop-first, mobile required.
- Brand tone: calm + confident + professional. NO kids gamification. NO “template SaaS demo” vibes.
- Domain: neuroteams.kz · app under `/platform/*` · funnels `/aistart`, kids promo out of this brief’s priority.

AESTHETIC DIRECTION
- Direction: Clean B2B product (serious learning OS).
- One aesthetic only — do not mix playful OriginKit neon with Swiss editorial on the same page.

PALETTE (MAX 3 BRAND HUES)
- Ink / navy: #0F172A (≈40% — text, dark bands, chrome)
- Primary: #2563EB (≈50% — CTA, links, active)
- Accent: #0D9488 (≈10% — teal highlight; NOT purple/violet)
- Semantic (separate, not brand):
  - Success: #059669
  - Warning: #D97706
  - Error: #DC2626
  - Info: #0284C7
- Surfaces:
  - --color-bg: #F8FAFC
  - --color-surface: #FFFFFF
  - --color-surface-soft: #F1F5F9
  - --color-text: #0F172A
  - --color-text-muted: #64748B
  - --color-border: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08)
Rules:
- No indigo→violet / purple mesh gradients (hard block).
- No glow-primary / glow-secondary purple haze.
- Flat, confident backgrounds; gradient only for intentional dark navy band (ink → #1E293B), never rainbow.
- All colors in CSS custom properties with semantic names.

TYPOGRAPHY
- Display (headlines / brand): Sora (600–700).
- Body / UI: Manrope (400 / 600 / 700).
- Mono (labels, “NT”, code): JetBrains Mono (500) — sparingly.
- Avoid Inter/Roboto/Geist as the only face “because default”.
- Body ≥ 16px. Scale ~1.25: 16 → 20 → 25 → 31 → 39.
- Max 3 weights in UI: Regular, SemiBold/Bold, ExtraBold only on display.

SPACING & LAYOUT
- 8-pt grid (4 as half-step). No 13px / 11px / 19px.
- Section padding varies: hero > content > footer.
- Layout primitives:
  - Marketing hero: brand-first; copy + full-bleed product/visual plane on desktop. No floating stickers on media.
  - Program / modules: numbered process list or track — not 3–4 identical icon cards.
  - Pricing: clear plan row + CTA sentence (verb + object + price when known).

SURFACES & CARDS
Anti-slop:
- Default surfaces borderless.
- Separation order: (1) whitespace (2) soft bg shift (3) soft elevation (4) border last.
- No gray border + shadow on every card.
- No decorative colored left strips.
- No neon border overlays / shiny pills as default decoration.

MOTION & STATES
- 150–250ms micro; ≤500ms section.
- No magnetic bounce, emoji burst, floating glyph rain.
- States required: hover, focus-visible, active, disabled, loading, empty, error.
- Focus ring: 0 0 0 3px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.35).

ACCESSIBILITY
- APCA targets: body Lc ≥ 75; large/bold ≥ 45; icons/borders ≥ 30.
- Text on dark / imagery needs overlay.

CONTENT & COPY
- No “Supercharge”, “Next-gen”, “AI for everyone”, “Try for free” without outcome.
- Product-grounded:
  - What: practical AI for business → artifacts / MVP.
  - Who: leaders & teams.
  - Outcome: shipable work, not theory.
- CTA = full sentence with verb + object + price/outcome
  (e.g. «Записаться на поток AI Start за 3 990 ₸» / «Открыть карту модулей»).
- Tone: «вы», business-register; no kids slang / emoji section labels.

AI-SLOP PATTERNS TO AVOID (HARD BLOCK)
- Purple/indigo gradient CTAs and mesh backgrounds.
- Inter-only stack without a display pairing from this brief.
- FloatingIcons / EmojiBurst / MagneticHover / NeonBorder / ShinyPill as default hero chrome.
- Three identical “why us” cards with vague icons.
- Floating pill nav + generic badge chip + centered H1 as the whole hero thesis.
- Dark mode as default without justification (dark bands OK; full dark app by default — no).

CHECKLIST BEFORE SHIPPING
- One aesthetic; ≤3 brand hues + semantic.
- Sora + Manrope; body ≥16px.
- Surfaces by space/bg/elevation, not gray borders everywhere.
- 8-pt grid; varied section rhythm.
- APCA passes; focus rings present.
- CTAs are outcome sentences.

SCOPE (priority)
1. Marketing home: `src/widgets/landing/LandingPage.tsx` + `globals.css` tokens
2. Student map + chrome: `ModuleMapClient.tsx`, platform header / SideNavBar
3. `/aistart` funnel: polish only if asked (keep conversion logic)

